/// \fn			CAtumApplication::CharacterChangeCurrentSP(SHORT CurrentSP)
/// \brief		FieldSocketCharacterChangeCurrentSP, FieldSocketCharacterChangeCurrentHPDPSPEPÇÔĽöżˇĽ­ SPşŻ°ć˝Ă »çżë
