///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
/// \fn			IMSocketGuildStartWar(MSG_IC_GUILD_START_WAR* pMsg)
/// \brief		MSG_IC_GUILD_START_WAR
/// \author		dhkwon
/// \date		2004-07-27 ~ 2004-07-27
/// \warning	Ĺ¬¶óŔĚľđĆ®´Â T_FC_GUILD_GET_WAR_INFO_OK ąŢŔş ČÄżˇ ÁřÂĄ ˝ĂŔŰŔĚ´Ů.
///				
/// \param		
/// \return		
